3	description: "Add or remove group members and leave chats through the content pipeline."
4	---
5	
6	import { TypeTooltip } from "/snippets/type-tooltip.mdx";
7	
8	Use `addMember()` and `removeMember()` to manage a group chat's members, and `leaveSpace()` to make the agent's own account leave the chat. All three are fire-and-forget: `space.send(...)` resolves to `undefined`.
