12	
13	await space.send(addMember("+15551234567"));
14	await space.send(removeMember(["+15551234567", "carol@example.com"]));
15	await space.send(leaveSpace());
16	```
17	
18	`space.add(users)`, `space.remove(users)`, and `space.leave()` are sugar for the canonical forms above.
19	
20	```ts
21	await space.add(alice);
22	await space.add(["+15551234567", bob]);
23	await space.remove("+15551234567");
24	await space.leave();
25	```
